  m_text: '<size=130%><b>YOUR ORDER: 1 BURGER</b></size>

    Bring ALL of these
    to the EXIT WINDOW:


    - Burger Bun  (just take it)

    - Lettuce  -> cut 
    (3 s)

    - Tomato  -> cut  (3 s)

    - Patty  -> cut (5 s) -> fry on stove
    (10 s)


    You get 3:00 in the maze after you leave this room.

    Finish
    faster for a higher score!'
